<title>SINGAPORE: Wing Tai 1H net profit up 111 pct.</title>
<headline>Wing Tai 1H net profit up 111 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     91.00    vs    43.20</p>
<p>    Group share (cts)    15.89    vs     7.64</p>
<p>    Turnover		324.53    vs   160.56</p>
<p>    Other income	    9.31    vs     4.83</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	116.31    vs    53.77</p>
<p>    Associates	     29.52    vs    15.74</p>
<p>    Tax			41.48    vs    20.88</p>
<p>    Minorities (loss)    13.35    vs     5.44 (loss)</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	 1.03    vs     0.03 (loss)</p>
<p>Note- Property based Wing Tai Holdings Ltd said ongoing property development projects contributed to the bulk of its turnover and results. The extraordinary item related to write-back of provisions for cessation of its garment making operations.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
